' bs_importlib.bs - a BrighterScript library module IMPORTED by test_bs.bs to
' device-test the `import` statement (multi-file). The deploy build transpiles this
' to a mangled global, so the imported call resolves and runs on the device — the
' on-device proof that a multi-file `import` lowers and executes (DEVICE_FACTS #18).
namespace bsimport
    function tag() as integer
        return 73
    end function
end namespace
